itics they gave Donald  Trump a 33 percent chance of winning  something like that I mean just because  it's not the majority that doesn't mean  that that can't happen and back to this  particular poll about only twenty four  percent of Americans trusting what comes  out of the Trump White House when only a  quarter of the people in the country  trust you believe what you say that is  going to cause a cascade of problems and  we're already seeing it and we will  likely continue to see it you can  discuss this with us on our reddit  discussion forum at david pakman.com  slash re d di t the video you just  watched was made possible by support  from you please go to  patreon.com/scishow you can make a  pledge  little as $1 per month and every dollar  helps to support the work that we're  doing particularly in light of the  YouTube ad boycott which has been really  bad
 

